<p>Just before retiring in 2011, Swiss cartographer Paul Ehrlich hid a drawing of a marmot in a map of the Aletsch Glacier.</p>
<p>Hidden drawings are <a href="https://www.swisstopo.admin.ch/en/hidden-images-20161221">something of a tradition</a> in Swiss maps.</p>
